# One proxy URL per line (file path or http(s) URL). Order = IP index 1..N.
# Apply with: scripts/vm/ph_iproyal_daily_pool.sh apply
#
# Default 5-IP split (daily < 5 confirmed):
#   IP1  daily_heavy   — once/day launch-page heavy pass (temp e2-standard-4 or scheduled job)
#   IP2  daily_people  — ph_people_daily page1 rotator (light PHUP)
#   IP3  daily_spare   — overlap / 700-page days
#   IP4  historical    — fleet pdeep L3_mid slot N
#   IP5  historical    — fleet pdeep L3_mid slot N+1
#
# Example (replace with real files after purchase):
# secrets/iproyal_daily_heavy.purl
# secrets/iproyal_daily_people.purl
# secrets/iproyal_daily_spare.purl
# secrets/iproyal_hist_4.purl
